    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29e579618b33f013230fb7c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迷人景致",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d00a4803d17b32d08d3d9ae9844b52810f0b4162c25dd8d8a1226ea163081d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        80,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/80/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73ac52c11c221c9c0ba1bc48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对不起、训练员……。\n明明想和你一起抵达的……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9157f34bddc8c8dd88f6a5b5df8c2d0173fa755298016db0b3eecc0d51fd67ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        80,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/80/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33c8735999dcd04489759e50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对于发生的变故、我也深感自责。\n但是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea9ff3cecd5b01c6112007dcc8a37928db6e1527a1447805f6a6d70d4c286007",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        81,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/81/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7c49912ee60626538321769",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“不被期待”……\n当真如此吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab18231904fe81a6f320fac344661cc54bb587897ee606eb00ced3707a107cb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        82,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/82/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:599eeb5d4c87f230a3f8e23d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然迷人景致依然坚强地表现出开朗、\n立誓要振作起来。但是理所当然地、\n她不可能立刻调整好心态……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52fd28e0c5a6bb4d2ba0e1f1f690a06da1079fa17503bf73acbdcd576fc6828d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        83,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/83/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd7bf1229bde2e14f831faaa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且……我也深受打击。\n太窝囊了。竟让她一个人去战斗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0d4f9fbd4e03208864de8792b9223aa63a4ca0009169d22aa430a6927db0062",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        84,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/84/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:238c320bc1736f6467b4d5a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（嗯？……有信息？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "40a445c6682ada4d080528b9e18edcee94b7df00031dc6f54a9405199377b387",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        85,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/85/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0b42300c21d15c4d9f2da2d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――那绝景、本应是我们两人共同去追寻的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e0728ad642817a3489382d431bc668534f7c61e398795f57fb106a8c342a32c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        85,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/85/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef5a05afc652c6de4fc9f37b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是某位粉丝的来信。\n上面写着――",
      "source_fingerprint": "820d88d1dcd215a03da42ab8de70a6a03f845d3006cbef74c08b679e38a2aa1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        86,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/86/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70dbc440972cf5ab2298bae7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『想为景致酱举办鼓励会』\n――希望我能够提供协助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0629dad23d592cd705f06f1c0adb5563b52449c03245b0c134290cc41679dee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        87,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/87/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21c61ba1fede7b0871de8c4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――我立刻回复。\n并附上『请一定要让我出一份力』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4eea969f51798895ec15c799a5c6c5ae9b7a4e9f60cfabe64fd8c3cdf28f9be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        88,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/88/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bae2dbad1a56b88989f55c81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "投向迷人景致的期待一如既往……\n不、今天甚至更胜以往的高涨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "211d34db6f2608ebe4e3b131aa982d60581c046f23389f4de9b41603a8126783",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c00db296db6ec4dde74624e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "景色变得朦胧",
      "source_fingerprint": "4315e5b3c3cc9816346c2000ad82137c8fd66dca40fbafe23c877336ceab383a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30902a7034bcf8972fa783b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "收到迷人景致的粉丝联络、\n我们决定为消沉的她举办一场鼓励会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2275d5b8ae8d065ec43bca9093caa925675ba2a220755352463c5e7a6a9c4bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2d7d2a5cff0fcf6addbdc7f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "筹办在日常训练之外悄悄推进着……\n迷人景致的脸上始终蒙着淡淡的阴霾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72d02bfc01d9af36fcf325bbfdeda52ed320dbfac4c603bab959bfd33b831f2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e4c970955399805c98efde",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "景致。……走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "051eb3dfdcb064d1fa423a5a057e93c320ee34199829cce021dbfe9ab1a03723",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1f67a6aa6515c068c4d436f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当一切准备就绪、活动正式开始。\n迷人景致仿佛害怕面对现实般、\n紧闭着双眼……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a903b23e64e236ba1a4847fcba10c07688c2d7b20b69ebddc452ca7245f7d3bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cef36356f9c1710f617d5b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "景致……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f46b0aed9d5d8acdde026edad7ec0f50bc0ad0ffb2f499f62e69facb52bc3e50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        100,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/100/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64726b80f068d6c0017a057d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迷人景致",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d00a4803d17b32d08d3d9ae9844b52810f0b4162c25dd8d8a1226ea163081d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114117.json",
      "json_path": [
